<!-- 扫码登录确认页：确认在电脑端登录（custom 全屏，顶部状态栏占位避免露黑边） -->
<view class="confirm-page">
  <view class="confirm-statusbar" style="height:{{safeTop}}px"></view>
  <view class="confirm-body">
    <view class="confirm-card">
      <view class="confirm-icon">
        <view class="confirm-icon-ring"></view>
        <text class="confirm-icon-mark">✓</text>
      </view>

      <view class="confirm-title">确认在电脑上登录</view>
      <view class="confirm-sub">扫码后即可在「衡账 · AI 项目对账平台」网页端登录</view>

      <block wx:if="{{status==='success'}}">
        <view class="confirm-done">
          <text class="confirm-done-title">确认成功</text>
          <text class="confirm-done-sub">请返回电脑端，页面将自动进入系统</text>
        </view>
        <view class="confirm-btn confirm-btn-ghost" bindtap="goHome">返回小程序首页</view>
      </block>

      <block wx:else>
        <view wx:if="{{status==='error'}}" class="confirm-error">{{error}}</view>
        <view class="confirm-btn {{status==='confirming' ? 'is-loading' : ''}}" bindtap="confirmLogin">
          {{status==='confirming' ? '确认中…' : '确认登录'}}
        </view>
        <view class="confirm-btn confirm-btn-ghost" bindtap="goHome">返回小程序首页</view>
        <view class="confirm-tip">{{devPreview ? '开发者工具预览模式（未扫码，仅用于检查 UI）' : '确认后代表你同意使用当前微信身份登录'}}</view>
      </block>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
